    "$f_u - yf_v$"
   ],
   "answer": "A",
   "solution": "$链式法则：\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x} = f_u \\cdot u_x + f_v \\cdot v_x = f_u \\cdot 1 + f_v \\cdot y。**答案：A**$"
  },
  {
