  {
   "id": "cal-md-015",
   "type": "choice",
   "difficulty": "medium",
   "question": "$设 z = x^2 + y^2 - \\ln\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}，则 \\frac{\\partial^2 z}{\\partial x^2} + \\frac{\\partial^2 z}{\\partial y^2} =（ ）$",
